{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_017_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:862ddc9a512fdd2e0c8d52261d5de82db4276bff692d595f1806f8fd8e784203",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:303befb9a232b458c20ae821a2677ed9e77bc38928bdaa1d3ffbdb2101f81205",
      "text": "猫柳邸",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3607cd922caeb3e6957331ab1f3b2806e38adeb91b556192d08cc511eed0f4c3",
      "text": "事情我大概明白了。\n只要别碍事，爱怎么拍就怎么拍吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9d7f20bdc46a0c5b572528bf0f91c2e04f8dac963b06b5449e2afc34c02870d",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n具体日期定下来之后，我会再次与您联络的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:521526fc00529df85d13cf2b434f2984e7fea3aaaac6a4b528958afc384e460f",
      "text": "……谈话好像结束了喵，\n●●●●プロデューサー君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6755f1559f6cfbe44a9104a85e9287f9f09ddaa3a8015e5215c67d77a185ed30",
      "text": "哇。怎么突然站起来了，\n桐生先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e0f0041b4456a988bb4643a0b1c93f8936a9e568bb86671420374f787b9577a",
      "text": "要不要再续一杯茶喵？\n点心也多拿点过来喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c18474b0c327a4cc2b9bd6c500c4c5b4242391786be5533d91c48cd002037c25",
      "text": "哎不对，难道是坐垫不够多？\n要再拿一块来喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c257b72333d84b08530ddb29aa4663719164aebf8f03d17af44854d21476ca62",
      "text": "傻瓜，统统用不着。\n搞什么啊，毛毛躁躁的家伙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aa447d8b2718214ce7c1a8730b65127503f07af368e185bd9eaba6569b766d0",
      "text": "你今天不是还干劲十足地说要把这个人当成素材吗。\n安安静静观察不就得了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55fc309936551dd89ec3883f15197248ffce3f9ff9a71d44d960d197ed7aa49d",
      "text": "喵、喵喵～……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
